{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31478","headline":"送郑京昭之云安 · 李羣玉","name":"送郑京昭之云安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君吟高唐赋，路过巫山渚。\n莫令巫山下，幽梦惹云雨。\n往事几千年，芬菲今尚传。\n空留荆王馆，岩嶂深苍然。\n楚水五月浪，轻舟入苹烟。\n送君扬檝去，愁绝郢城篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}